    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011e6f2eeca9506525ec1970",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天也谢谢你的帮忙！\n小火山的舞台吸引了好多人潮啊！\n客人也变多，真是太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6e938b11f2f8263bccb89ba60ec023f94b1d1a931d1f216421ac449259f43d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
