      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，要是有帮上忙就太开心了！\n我会继续以吸引客人为目标加倍努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed42cc03c570565f0481f7c3f6f3f4897e2c29897c367d8557eff5a960ecaeb8",
